YZ Source-Available License v1.0

1. DEFINITIONS
"Software" means all source code, binaries, installers, icons, documentation
and other materials in this repository. "Modified version" means any derivative
work. "Resale" means providing the Software or a substantially equivalent copy
to others for consideration of any kind, including money, credits,
subscriptions, bundled sales, or use as a gift with a paid course or service.
"Commercial use" means using the Software in any business activity, including
taking client work, freelancing, or providing paid technical support.

2. YOU MAY
(a) download, install and run the Software for any lawful purpose, including
    commercial use;
(b) read, learn from, modify the source code and build your own version for
    personal or internal use;
(c) copy and redistribute the Software **free of charge only**, with this
    license included and copyright notices intact;
(d) charge your own clients for your own technical services performed using
    the Software — you are selling your skills, not the Software;
(e) teach or sell educational content you create, provided it does not include
    a copy of the Software itself.

3. YOU MAY NOT
(a) resell the Software or any substantially equivalent copy, whether renamed,
    re-iconed or re-skinned;
(b) sell the Software as part of a paid product, including paid courses, paid
    community perks, paid file-sharing bundles, marketplace listings, or
    "installation services" whose substance is the Software itself;
(c) remove or alter copyright notices, attribution or this license;
(d) claim authorship of the Software or imply you developed it;
(e) use the Software for unlawful activity, bulk harassment, spam or flooding.

4. MODIFIED VERSIONS
Modified versions remain bound by this license, must not be resold, must retain
attribution and this license, and must not be distributed under the "YZ" name or
icon. The name and icon are not licensed.

5. CONTRIBUTIONS
By submitting a pull request, issue or patch, you grant the project the right to
distribute your contribution under this license and later versions. Your
attribution is preserved in commit history.

6. DISCLAIMER
THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. THE AUTHOR IS
NOT LIABLE FOR ANY DAMAGES ARISING FROM ITS USE.

7. TERMINATION
Rights terminate automatically upon violation, and are reinstated if the
violation is fully cured within 30 days of notice. Lawfully obtained copies may
continue to be used for personal, non-commercial purposes after termination.

8. MISCELLANEOUS
The Chinese text governs. Invalid provisions do not affect the remainder. Future
versions may adopt a different license; already published versions remain under
the license in effect at their release.
